{"mode":"words","text":"Šo vārdu pa vārdam tulkojumu sauc par dekodēšanu. Tas apzināti izklausās neveikli — jo tieši tā tu redzi, kā valoda patiesībā ir uzbūvēta, nemaz nemācoties no galvas gramatikas noteikumus. Agrāk to darīja stundām ilgi ar rokām, izmantojot vārdnīcu. LinguaFlow lietotne šo posmu veic pilnībā tavā vietā — katram tekstam, ko vēlies apgūt.","words":[{"s":0,"e":160},{"s":240,"e":560},{"s":613,"e":720},{"s":760,"e":1040},{"s":1100,"e":1760},{"s":1813,"e":2000},{"s":2040,"e":2160},{"s":2240,"e":3120},{"s":3720,"e":4080},{"s":4160,"e":4640},{"s":4667,"e":5200},{"s":5253,"e":5840},{"s":6040,"e":6240},{"s":6293,"e":6400},{"s":6460,"e":6880},{"s":6960,"e":7120},{"s":7200,"e":7360},{"s":7400,"e":7680},{"s":7720,"e":7840},{"s":7880,"e":8240},{"s":8300,"e":8960},{"s":8987,"e":9040},{"s":9080,"e":10240},{"s":10280,"e":10560},{"s":10600,"e":11200},{"s":11253,"e":11360},{"s":11420,"e":11760},{"s":11808,"e":12320},{"s":12384,"e":13280},{"s":13540,"e":14480},{"s":14533,"e":14640},{"s":14680,"e":14960},{"s":15013,"e":15600},{"s":15664,"e":15920},{"s":15973,"e":16080},{"s":16140,"e":16560},{"s":16587,"e":17200},{"s":17240,"e":18000},{"s":18224,"e":19600},{"s":19653,"e":20320},{"s":20560,"e":20960},{"s":21060,"e":21440},{"s":21493,"e":21680},{"s":21740,"e":22240},{"s":22300,"e":22560},{"s":22624,"e":23040},{"s":23480,"e":23920},{"s":23980,"e":24320},{"s":24373,"e":24800},{"s":24827,"e":24880},{"s":24960,"e":25360},{"s":25413,"e":26000}]}